WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:04,960
Xiaoxiao, come down and wash the tree. Get ready for breakfast.

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:20,020
Another medical ability. What's wrong with her?

3
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,920
Stare at me every day

4
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,740
I'm going to activate new medical abilities.

5
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,940
The wound on the thigh will be healed in one night

6
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,140
I don't feel bad anymore

7
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,940
No soreness in the waist and no pain in the legs

8
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:34,990
It really doesn't hurt anymore

9
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:37,190
Most of the time

10
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:50,230
Tian Luo boy who secretly treated someone last night

11
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:51,910
Here it is

12
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:11,980
It seems that all the funerals have gone away this morning

13
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:14,320
Really gone

14
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,320
We took turns taking turns all night long

15
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:19,150
They also walked all night

16
00:01:19,150 --> 00:01:21,550
Hurry up and have breakfast and leave as soon as you finish eating
